A '''skyscraper''' of the [[New Republic]] was located on [[Coruscant]] during the [[New Republic Era]]. The [[skyscraper]] was bulky in design and was visually similar to [[New Republic Coruscant skyscraper|another building]] that housed the [[New Republic Amnesty Program]]'s [[parole office]]. The building also housed [[Colonel]] [[Tuttle]]'s [[Tuttle's office|office]]<ref name="Chapter 21" /> as well as a [[Congenial Archive|New Republic archival office]].<ref name="Chapter 19" />

